WEBVTT

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:04.400
This can't be happening...

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:07.470
How could Karasuma be in a place like this...?

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.440
Wait a... Dojima.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.180
What is it?

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:23.350
You said an assault team from headquarters is going to attack this place soon, right?

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.480
Huh? Yeah...

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.910
Then we have to stop them, and stop them fast.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:32.730
This place is rigged to crush everything in it if there's an emergency.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.430
If we're not careful, we'll all be crushed.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.170
I knew it, I'm not getting through.

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:44.070
What is it?

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:45.840
The attack is going to start.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:50.300
We had it planned so the attack would begin immediately if my signal was cut off.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:51.810
Let's move.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.520
Intruders are crossing the security line.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.550
Seal security gates.

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:06.320
Security personnel, circle behind the gates and stand by for intruders.

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:18.240
November Foxtrot to command base.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:21.270
Have just passed point 3-A. Proceeding to combat altitude.

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:29.280
They're equipped with heavy weaponry?

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:35.520
I understand. Speed up the evacuation of the scientists.

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:38.890
Is it an attack by headquarters?

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:40.630
That would be my guess.

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:43.790
But sir, why would they rush matters like this?

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.730
I have no idea.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:49.270
Is something the matter, sir?

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:50.860
Toudou's ROM!

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:53.900
Of course! There must be something on it!

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.110
What's your file decoding progress?

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:58.740
We're currently at about 78%.

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:00.270
Send it to me at once.

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:01.640
Very well, sir.

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:05.110
What is it?

00:02:05.550 --> 00:02:10.390
About that test subject, sir. She's tested negative for Orbo extraction.

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:11.620
Eliminate her.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:14.700
Eliminate her, sir?

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:18.100
But I believe she may prove to be an excellent specimen for further testing.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.230
You do, do you?

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:31.180
All right, fine.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:37.610
It's offline.

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.220
Does that mean the attack's started?

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.150
Probably.

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:42.790
We have to go.

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:44.550
Go where? Up?

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.260
Going up there now would be dangerous.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:49.800
I know that.

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:50.990
You do, huh?

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:54.560
What about the elevator? How do you suggest we get it working?

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:57.340
I think I might be able to help out with that.

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.310
You can?

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:03.180
There ought to be someplace that lets you control the elevator directly.

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:06.880
For instance... someplace like that.

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:10.640
Dojima, jump in once I get the door open.

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.080
But Michael...

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:17.120
This situation isn't going to be solved by staying put down here.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.490
Besides, where you're going is even more dangerous.

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:22.520
I'll keep you company.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.060
This won't exactly be safe, either.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.270
Yeah, I know.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:29.930
Sakaki...

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.470
I guess I'll tag along with you, little lady.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.010
I'll go with you, too, Dojima.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:37.950
No. You and I are staying here.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:44.680
Robin. There's something that you need to take care of down here, right?

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:46.480
Nagira...

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:48.550
Amon...

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:06.530
Let's get to it...

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:40.940
It's me.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.740
The elevator's moving?

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.980
Robin's group, huh?

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.780
Send security personnel to the elevator hall immediately.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:53.080
That's right.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.680
One more thing...

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:58.990
How's it going?

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:00.190
They'll probably be okay.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:02.830
I think we've been spotted by now, though.

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:10.940
We have company!

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.270
Keep 'em busy, Haruto...

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:35.520
...must be eradicated...
...by the ultimate Witch...

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:42.300
I believe you've seen it by now. Robin's true form.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:46.170
Robin is no mere Witch.

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:48.480
Can you tolerate power like hers?

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:53.080
Can you let a world to come to pass in which the artificially created strong...

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.410
...make the weak bow down to them?

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.950
It's all up to you.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:08.090
Even if your abilities have weakened, it doesn't change the fact that you're a Witch.

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:13.060
Will you join me and survive as a hunter,

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:17.500
...or will you become a fugitive just like Robin?

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.670
I'll give you one last chance.

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:26.710
One last chance? You want me to hunt Robin?

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:28.580
That's right.

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:33.450
Where is she?

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:36.520
She seems to be somewhere inside this facility.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:06.140
Son of a...

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:10.320
How much longer, Michael?

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:13.620
C'mon, c'mon!

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:17.100
Just a little more! It's all up to you now, Lady Dojima!

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:22.430
They know we're here. Don't get yourself killed, lady.

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:23.930
Same to you.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:10.780
I never imagined that it would be you who would come to visit me.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:14.180
Karasuma... What did you do to Karasuma?

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:19.150
You came here over such a trivial matter?

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:21.360
Trivial matter?

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:24.770
She's working for me, just as she always has.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:28.070
Unlike you, Amon.

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:31.610
That isn't the only reason we came here.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:37.170
The message Toudou left with you 15 years ago.

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:40.050
You know about that ROM?

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:47.950
Do you know what's in the message he recorded on it?

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.220
Not everything, no.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:54.790
In spite of that, you still want to know?

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.760
If it explains who I really am.

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:02.730
You're absolutely certain, then?

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:17.150
Toudou...

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:27.180
Zaizen, by the time you, or anyone else, listens to this,

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:29.760
...I will most likely be dead.

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:34.530
But I can't consign my research to oblivion.

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:40.310
This work done by me, a mere Solomon research scientist.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:43.700
As a member of the Genome... ...perfect Witch...

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:47.500
I have named this project Project Robin,

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:50.150
...playing off the name of the King of Witches.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:54.820
My colleagues have laughed off this project, calling it "Project Devil Child,"

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:58.720
...and have given me the cold shoulder, dismissing it as a mere armchair theory.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:05.530
And I would probably have never put the project into motion if I had not met her.

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:06.330
Maria?

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:12.970
Normally, Solomon should have found me out when they pulled the plug on all our research.

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:17.940
But they were far too lenient when it came to my research.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:23.010
My results eventually came to run counter to Solomon's ideals.

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:28.920
As luck would have it, the project made it to its final stage without being uncovered.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:35.300
To Solomon, I expect that its existence will be something that they will be unable to admit to.

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:40.920
However, her father was the one person I was unable to deceive.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:44.940
Juliano Colegli. He will never...

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:48.440
The Devil's child.

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:52.380
Do you understand now? That is what you really are.

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:55.050
Is that all?

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:55.850
What?

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:58.320
Is that all of what Toudou left?

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:01.350
What more do you expect there to be?

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:03.360
It's me.

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:06.680
Forget about the missing parts, just put it up on the monitor right away.

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:13.130
To Solomon, the success of Project Robin...

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:16.360
...would mean the rebirth of the Devil in a literal sense.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:20.900
Her existence is the very past which they must obliterate.

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:29.750
In ancient times, mankind was ruled by a new species of humanity called "gods".

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:34.290
The species that possessed special powers, Witches in other words,

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:36.920
...were nothing less than gods to us.

00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:44.260
But a genetic mutation in a god born about 3,000 years ago...

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:48.830
...changed their destiny, as well as that of us humans.

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:51.770
The gods, having lost the ability to pass on their own genetic elements...

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:54.440
...to their descendants due to this mutation,

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:58.110
...lost their status as heirs to humanity.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:59.650
What does he mean?

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:03.710
Humanity, having risen to power, feared the rebirth of the gods.

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:07.620
They suppressed and controlled them over the years,

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.860
...putting them in the position of devils and witches,

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:12.350
...species that had powers that humans were not meant to possess.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.400
That is the truth behind Solomon.

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:21.630
This research was branded with the mark of heresy, and Solomon destroyed it all.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:28.470
Witches are our successors?

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:30.480
That's impossible.

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:34.110
We humans are a species that's inferior to Witches?

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:42.280
Delete all the files! Including the ones you've decoded so far!

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:44.120
Wait!

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:49.390
Are you sure, sir?

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.220
I don't care! Do it!

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:53.730
Stop that!

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:57.800
Continue the playback.

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:00.000
Karasuma...!

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:04.450
I attempted to recreate a Witch...

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:08.070
...that had their innate powers, and had the ability to inherit the species,

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:12.790
I met a hunter named Maria and fell in love with her.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.820
Karasuma, are you trying to betray me?

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.660
Maria's body had been frail since childhood.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:15.160
I'm not betraying you.

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:16.660
I was terrified of losing who I am.

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:19.430
I was terrified of losing who I am.
She had been given only a few years to live due to a chromosomal abnormality.

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:21.660
She had been given only a few years to live due to a chromosomal abnormality.

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:21.660
I had to cling to something.

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:28.500
I was afraid that if I didn't, I'd gradually fall to pieces.

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:30.070
But it was those abnormal chromosomes that were the key to a perfect Witch.

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:31.610
I never believed anything you said!

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:32.830
I can do nothing to save her life.

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:35.740
But within her is a new life,

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:39.780
...a child who may be able to change the future.

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:41.680
Change the future?

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:45.520
My mind has become obsessed with this fascinating idea.

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:45.520
There is only one future!

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:48.560
And you have no place in it!

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:50.860
It is clear that Solomon will try to exterminate this child.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.260
Neither do you!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:51.290
Or you!

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:52.490
...not its power, but...

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:56.090
...the ability of Witches to once again inherit the species.

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:59.300
They are terrified that this child will become the Eve of Witches,

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:01.500
...believing that she will be a threat to them.

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:05.060
You're the Eve of Witches? That's supposed to be the truth?

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:05.060
Is what I have done...

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.270
He's wrong!

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:11.750
Witches are simply filth! A race that pollutes the pure water that is humanity!

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:14.020
As my final gamble, I have decided to entrust this unborn child to Juliano.

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:15.380
To protect the beauty of that purity, to protect humanity,

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:18.790
...capable of killing Maria's child?

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:18.790
...we must wipe Witches off the face of the Earth!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:22.960
I will stake her slim chances of survival on him.

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:24.020
Even if Witches were God's chosen, just like humans?

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:28.400
But he will probably never forgive me.

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:26.660
Chosen by God?

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:29.630
Why did that abnormality occur in their genes, then?

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:30.000
For all eternity.

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:34.930
In the end, wasn't it because they were unfit to become humanity's successors?

00:14:35.240 --> 00:14:38.040
Because they were forsaken by God?!

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.230
God doesn't forsake anyone.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:46.340
I'll admit that I can't fully accept the existence of Witches, either.

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:54.050
But I have to accept what that man said just now as the truth.

00:14:57.220 --> 00:14:58.050
No.

00:14:58.860 --> 00:14:59.830
It's not!

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:04.660
Witches are the beings that will take humanity's place?

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.490
I won't accept that!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.000
It's nonsense!

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.240
What's wrong?

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:19.210
The Witches in the tanks have started a system runaway...!

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:26.710
But the Witches inside them are...

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:30.750
I don't understand. If we don't do something, the self-destruct device will activate, and...

00:15:33.060 --> 00:15:34.190
Self-destruct device?

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:36.260
It'll bring down the building!

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:39.860
That's impossible. Why would they...

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.200
It's you?

00:15:45.140 --> 00:15:47.610
Your very existence is what is causing those ghosts to...

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.680
Now I see.

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:54.910
I have to kill both you and Toudou's nonsense!

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:58.040
This is also God's will.

00:15:58.790 --> 00:16:02.120
This is the purest Orbo we've ever made.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.290
Don't!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:04.220
Shut up!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:19.770
Weren't you listening? This is our purest Orbo ever.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.680
Your Witch power can't touch me.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.150
The Orbo side-effect...

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:34.720
No, I won't give in...

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:38.890
Not until I defeat this Witch...

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:44.020
You defeat Witches using Orbo that you made from us?

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:50.500
I won't forgive you.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:53.470
I'm not about to ask for your forgiveness!

00:16:58.480 --> 00:17:00.350
Juliano told me something.

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:04.810
He said that woman... Maria... He said she called me "hope".

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:07.180
Hope, huh? Don't make me laugh!

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:16.390
There's no hope for your kind!

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:28.540
What have I done?

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:39.350
Does this mean that headquarters was right all along?

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:50.560
This place is going to come down. We've got to get out of here, Robin.

00:17:57.240 --> 00:18:00.670
The blood of Witches that have been persecuted...

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:03.670
...since ancient times flows inside of me.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:08.870
I don't just know the power. I know the sadness caused by that power.

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:14.490
Maybe that's why that woman called me "hope".

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.290
A Witch who knows sadness...

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:22.590
...might be able to understand humans even when surrounded by a sea of them.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.670
That's why l...

00:18:29.070 --> 00:18:33.010
I don't know whether or not you ought to exist.

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:37.000
But the only way to find that answer is for you to survive.

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:40.670
If what Karasuma was worried about ever comes to pass,

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:44.280
...I'll kill you before it can happen, Robin.

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:48.750
I guess that makes you my watchdog.

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:04.410
What's wrong?

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:08.000
I hear screams... They're all crying.

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:29.060
Let's go!

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:48.650
Maria told me something.

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:53.890
She said that if she could change the future with the power that's lying dormant within her,

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:55.880
...she wanted to pass it on to this child.

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:11.440
As my final gamble, I have decided to entrust this unborn child to Juliano.

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:16.010
Will he be capable of killing Maria's child?

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:22.080
I will stake her slim chances of survival on him.

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:28.880
But he will probably never forgive me.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.920
For all eternity.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:36.060
Worm to Charlie.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.060
Collapse seems to extend to entire facility.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:44.100
Request temporary abeyance of assault plan until ground situation is verified.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:47.660
Charlie, roger that. Glad you're alive.

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:49.140
Thanks.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:59.580
I want my STN-J members extracted at once!

00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:07.390
You made it!

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:14.890
Hold your fire!

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:17.630
Miho!

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.740
I'm amazed you guys made it out.

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:25.480
Where are Amon and Robin?

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:28.210
What, they weren't with you two?

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:30.780
Then they're still...

00:21:32.320 --> 00:21:36.260
Aw, don't worry. Those two aren't dead.

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:39.620
How do you know that?

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:42.960
I dunno. Something tells me, I guess.

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:49.200
It was a fluke. A fluke and a miracle.

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:55.440
No, that wasn't it. It wasn't like that.

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.710
Are you saying that Robin and Amon are...

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:04.550
No. I don't know what happened to them.

00:22:10.690 --> 00:22:13.020
The two of them were caught in the collapse.

00:22:14.190 --> 00:22:15.750
That's what happened, all right.

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:31.840
Good, just like we planned.

00:22:32.180 --> 00:22:35.020
And so, we went back to hunting...

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:34.620
Follow him in and corner him.

00:22:34.620 --> 00:22:36.050
Hm? That's strange...

00:22:35.020 --> 00:22:37.280
...day in, day out, just like before.

00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:38.840
Haruto, report your status!

00:22:41.720 --> 00:22:44.280
Of course, there were a few changes.

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:47.690
Careful, sir, it's hot.

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:52.860
Administrator, about the new hunter who's being assigned to us today...

00:22:56.970 --> 00:22:59.910
I warned you that it was hot, sir!

00:23:04.850 --> 00:23:07.540
Sir? Here are the files for your next case.

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:09.750
And one other thing...

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:13.210
When is that delinquent of a girl going to come back?

00:23:14.150 --> 00:23:15.620
What do you mean, "when"?

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:19.180
Some lawyer you are, not being able to reform one little girl.

00:23:19.630 --> 00:23:21.590
Hurry up and drag her back here.

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:30.930
Amon and Robin left this Earth when the Factory collapsed.

00:23:32.410 --> 00:23:35.930
That's what Miss Dojima said, but I don't really believe her.

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:41.380
I mean, do you expect me to believe a word she says?

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:45.720
Am I right?

00:25:46.510 --> 00:25:50.500
Expect a wonderful encounter. Your lucky color is black.
